      "y": -180,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "Asimon, drawn.\nSeven power cards with a shared back, twelve topic emblems, seven round twists — all in the same chunky flat style as the fifteen faces the game already draws.\n\nThis is what shipped. Two things were cut along the way: badges on the board nodes (four columns of pills is dense enough on a phone) and a topic watermark behind every word card (the topic is already drawn once, right above them).\n\nBoard G is the one that decided it: everything at 390×844, the size it is actually played at."
